      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i just sit there thinking about how the universe is basically just expanding into nothingness and eventually everything—every memory, every achievement, every single person—is just gonna be gone forever. it makes everything feel so incredibly heavy and pointless. like, why even bother trying to build anything or be anything if the end result is just total void?",
